    {
      "start": 4.75,
      "end": 11.458333333333334,
      "text": "Put them on a range: the hands that fit their preflop action, then the hands that still fit the flop."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.458333333333334,
      "end": 20.75,
      "text": "On king-eight-three, villain can have strong value, but they can also have ace-high, smaller pairs, worse kings, and bluffs."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.75,
      "end": 25.208333333333332,
      "text": "If you decide they always have aces, you are not hand reading."
